  "notes": [
    "\u00a78 is described as 25 tokens in tracking (issues #9/#11, PRs #10/#12), but its table actually contains 27 rows. This file includes all 27; nothing was dropped to match the count. Samir's call if the count matters.",
    "Font-family and colour tokens are SETTLED (Samir adopted Neo's palette recommendation 2026-11-25). System font stacks only \u2014 no webfont download for the default theme. All six text contrast ratios were verified by computation against the stated backgrounds and match exactly. Light muted (#5C5C57) is AA and secondary-text only. Exception: --wd-color-thumb (issue #80) is Proposal — Samir has not settled the value.",
    "Settled \u00a79 decisions that are not \u00a78 tokens (root font size 16px; fluid layout as the primary mechanism; centre-crop for images in v0.1) are recorded in design-policies.md \u00a79, not as tokens here. If \u00a78 gains tokens for them, this file gains matching entries.",
    "Formulas are written in vw/vh for the full-screen case; the renderer MUST use container query units (cqw/cqh) when the deck is embedded in a page, card or iframe (design-policies \u00a70, spec \u00a77.2). Read vw as 1% of container width and vh as 1% of container height throughout.",
    "A dash (\u2014) in \u00a78 means the bound does not apply; it is null here.",
    "The 'title factor' and 'count factor' in the font preferred formulas are defined in design-policies \u00a72 (panel-count factors 1.00 / 0.92 / 0.84 / 0.78, gentler title factors). The layout engine applies them before clamping."
  ],
